{"title": "[花邊] Curry抨擊近期針對他老婆的不當言論", "author": "XXXaBg (對的事情做一千次)", "board": "", "date": "Thu Nov 12 08:39:46 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1794443989.A.74D.html", "body": "https://x.com/warriorsworld/status/2120608154702811277\n\n內有影片\n\nSteph responds to the clowns disrespecting Ayesha... specifically Gil and Nick Y\noung.\n\nSometimes you gotta smack the clowns around\n\nSteph 回應那些不尊重 Ayesha 的小丑們……特別是 Arena\ns\n 和 Nick Young。\n\n有時候你得把那些小丑\n胖揍\n一頓\n\n完整發言：\n\nI've been hearing a lot of noise, and usually the noise doesn't bother me, doesn\n't bother Ayesha.\n\nBut this one in particular, when you try to step on the accomplishments of my wi\nfe and obviously, leading podcast tapings and topics and giving opinions on some\nbody else's wife.\n\n最近我聽到了很多外界的雜音。通常這些批評不會影響我，也不會影響 Ayesha。\n\n但這次的情況不一樣。你們試圖貶低我妻子所取得的成就，甚至還把這件事拿來當作 Podca\n\nst 節目的主題，在節目中大肆討論，對別人的妻子品頭論足。\n\nNick, Gil, Emmanuel and anybody else who feels the need to jump in and give an o\npinion on something you don't really know about.\n\nSomething that kind of speaks to a bigger conversation on how you view women in\nthis world and what they're allowed and what they're not allowed to do. Even the\n ignorance behind how acting works.\n\nNick、Gil、Emmanuel，以及其他所有覺得自己有必要跳進來、對自己根本不了解的事情發\n\n表意見的人。\n\n這件事其實反映出一個更深層的問題：你們究竟如何看待這個世界上的女性？你們認為女性\n\n可以做什麼，又有哪些事情是不被允許的？甚至連演戲這件事是怎麼運作的，你們都缺乏基\n\n本的理解。\n\nObviously, I tried to laugh this one off, but something needs to be said.\n\nAnytime Ayesha Curry shows up in your headline, I'd kindly suggest you just give\n the happy hands, the congratulations, and maybe the apology can be as loud as y\n'all leading y'all shows with this topic.\n\n我原本確實試著把這件事當作笑話，一笑置之，但有些話還是必須說清楚。\n\n每當 Ayesha Curry 出現在你們的新聞標題裡，我想我可以客氣地建議你們，不妨拍拍手、\n\n給她一些祝賀。或許，你們也應該拿出當初在節目中大肆討論這件事時的同等聲量，公開向\n\n她道歉。\n\nAppreciate the free pub. Thank you for giving a nice shout out to Second Chance\nHoliday, which y'all can find on Roku, starring Ayesha Curry.\n\n也謝謝你們免費幫忙宣傳。感謝你們替《Second Chance Holiday》打廣告，這部由 Ayesha\n\n Curry 主演的電影，可以在 Roku 上收看。\n\nhttps://x.com/big_business_/status/2120627125199802828\n\nGilbert Arenas and Nick Young respond to Steph Curry and apologize on air:\n\nGilbert Arenas: “All I said is he doesn’t get in trouble for nothing. He says\nthe right things. If you gotta judge this family, his only blemish is what his w\nife said. That’s all I said. If there is a blemish, it’s that.”\n\nNick Young: “Ay, fuck all that. This man Gil won’t say sorry at all. I’m sorr\ny, Steph. You my dog. I love you. If I offended you, I apologize like a man. I’\nm sorry.”\n\nGilbert Arenas 和 Nick Young 在節目中回應 Stephen Curry，並公開向他道歉：\n\nGilbert Arenas：\n\n「我說的只是，Steph 這個人從來不會惹上什麼麻煩。他總是知道該說什麼、該怎麼做。如\n\n果你真的要挑剔這個家庭，那他唯一的污點就是他老婆說過的那些話。這就是我全部想表達\n\n的意思。如果這個家庭真的有什麼缺點，那就是這件事。」\n\nNick Young：\n\n「欸，去他的，別再扯那些了！Gil 這傢伙根本連一句對不起都不肯說。我跟你道歉，Step\n\nh。你是我的好兄弟，我愛你。如果我說的話冒犯了你，我就像個男人一樣，堂堂正正地向\n\n你道歉。對不起。」\n\n最近一直看到國外一堆噁心文說什麼 Curry 是看到老婆在劇中如何如何 把氣出在球場上才\n大爆發 原來是出自這幾個咖 然後都要你道歉了是在嘴硬什麼 有夠沒水準的人", "comments": [{"tag": "→", "user": "xjapan329", "content": "[車神]咖哩老婆硬實力深度分析", "time": "11/12 08:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "hunt5566", "content": "Nick Young是真的很會鬼扯", "time": "11/12 08:42"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Chanlin01", "content": "老公都不car了 其他人在喊燒哦", "time": "11/12 08:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "f92174", "content": "小丑:不要打我", "time": "11/12 08:42"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ji394vul3nn", "content": "這兩個可憐哪", "time": "11/12 08:43"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "watermelon20", "content": "車神分析完要道歉嗎 XD", "time": "11/12 08:46"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "ClownT", "content": "@太吾車神", "time": "11/12 08:46"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "sky070650", "content": "\"如果真的要挑剔這個家庭\" ??? 關他們屁事", "time": "11/12 08:47"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nt880245", "content": "咖哩不介意", "time": "11/12 08:48"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "chenliu0716", "content": "就是硬蹭一波流量故意搞爭議", "time": "11/12 08:48"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lifehappy36", "content": "推咖哩護妻", "time": "11/12 08:49"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "JRSmith", "content": "那部劇情很爛就是了", "time": "11